    -- FORK s267A-1 | s 267A | `s 267A the person may apply to the court for an order compelling the trustee to perform the trustee's duties` | took NOTHING for anyone else (the text opens with "Without affecting any other right") | other reading JUST FALSE | licence {IN-SHORT} (a list not closed) and {G1}

