    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "it is sufficient for particulars of the net amount outstanding in respect of any such advance to be provided every 3 months"
    -- The text says what is sufficient where an advance is merged in a current account; it does not say that nothing else is.

