    `the person contravenes section 268A(6)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the person contravene section 268A(6)?
    `the person contravenes section 268A(7)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the person contravene section 268A(7)?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 268A(8) the person is guilty of an offence` MEANS
    IF `the person contravenes section 268A(6)` OR `the person contravenes section 268A(7)`
