    -- FORK s268A-8 | s 268A(8) | `s 268A(8) the person is guilty of an offence` | took JUST FALSE where neither contravention is shown | other reading NOTHING | licence {G2} and the brief's split site (i)

@ref s 268A(8) (src:42470-42474)
GIVETH A Penalty
`s 268A(8) the penalty for the offence` MEANS
    -- fine not exceeding $15,000; no imprisonment (0 months); a further fine not exceeding $1,000 for every day or part of a day the offence continues after conviction
    Penalty OF 15000, 0, FALSE, 1000

-- src:42478 | (9) Any person who provides any information contained in a
