    `the person provides information contained in a semi-annual report required under subsection (2)` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the person provide information contained in a semi-annual report required under section 268A(2)?
    `the person uses due care to ensure that the information is not false or misleading in any material particular` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the person use due care to ensure that the information is not false or misleading in any material particular?
