        THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Any person who provides any information contained in a semi‑annual report required under subsection (2)"
        IF `the person uses due care to ensure that the information is not false or misleading in any material particular`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "must use due care to ensure that the information is not false or misleading in any material particular"

-- src:42485 | (10) Any person who contravenes subsection (9) shall be guilty of
