GIVETH A DEONTIC `s 268 party` `s 268 act`
`s 268(9) the duty of the trustee to lodge notice with the Authority` MEANS
    PARTY `s 268 the trustee for the holders of the debentures`
    MUST `s 268(9) lodge notice with the Authority that the accounts were not lodged`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `s 268 the trustee for the holders of the debentures` BECAUSE "the trustee did not lodge notice with the Authority"
    -- FORK s268-9i | s 268(9) | `s 268(9) the duty of the trustee to lodge notice with the Authority` | took "immediately" as a promptness standard with no number of days or hours the clock can count, so the rule has no WITHIN and no breach path | other reading WITHIN 0 (the same day), under which a trace one day late reaches BREACH | licence {CC} (a bare "must" not done, decided on the text's own words)

-- src:42356 | (11) Where the trustee has by written notice given the trustee’s
-- src:42357 | consent under subsection (10), the directors or equivalent persons of
-- src:42358 | the borrowing entity, or the directors or equivalent persons of the
-- src:42359 | guarantor entity, in respect of whose profit and loss account and
-- src:42360 | balance sheet the notice was given, must lodge with the Authority a
-- src:42361 | copy of the notice at the time when the profit and loss account and
-- src:42362 | balance sheet to which the notice relates are lodged with the
-- src:42363 | Authority.
@ref s 268(11) (src:42356-42363)
GIVETH A DEONTIC `s 268 party` `s 268 act`
`s 268(11) the duty to lodge a copy of the trustee's notice with the Authority at the time the accounts are lodged` MEANS
    PARTY `s 268 the directors or equivalent persons`
    MUST `s 268(11) lodge a copy of the trustee's notice with the Authority`
    WITHIN 0
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `s 268 the directors or equivalent persons` BECAUSE "the copy of the trustee's notice was not lodged with the Authority at the time the accounts were lodged"
    -- WITHIN 0: the clock starts on the day the accounts are lodged with the Authority; "at the time when" is read as the same day (fork s268-11t).

