`s 268A(1) the duty to prepare and make available a semi-annual report` MEANS
    PARTY `s 268 the borrowing entity`
    MUST `s 268A(1) prepare and make available a semi-annual report`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `s 268 the borrowing entity` BECAUSE "no semi-annual report was prepared and made available to the holders"

-- src:42401 | (2) The borrowing entity must ensure that each semi‑annual report
